'the cur':2599B 'ths':2686B 'ths</h3>\n':2304B 'tical ':2628B 'ticsearch or ':1881B 'ties (lo':1772B 'ting)</':553B 'tion (':2544B 'tion and':1305B 'tion done ':2423B 'tion</stro':2364B 'tistics</h':634B 'tit':2312B 'tlenecks</h':1185B 'to':680B,749B 'to ':1353B 'to e':2687B 'to-arch':2157B 'toring</li':2066B 'trail':2331B 'tre':2173B 'tream = r':2181B 'tream&#39;':2184B 'tream.par':2211B 'tributed ~2':673B 'trong>':56B,59B,69B,72B,81B,83B,92B,94B 'truc':2345B 'tructure,':34B 'tructure<':82B 'ts = []':2202B 'ts disk ':2649B 'ts for':2037B 'ts))\n  ':2233B 'ts.push':2224B 'ts</li':1999B 'ts</strong>. with ':2612B 'tures)</':590B,603B 'tweight, s':1553B 'u':1246B,1343B,1415B,1500B,1683B,1851B,1923B,1961B,2005B 'uage-jav':1312B,1379B,1443B,1796B,1878B 'uage-sql':1551B,1664B 'ual jo':1287B 'ub':1854B 'ub-mil':1853B 'ucture va':970B 'udit ':29B 'ue not':1566B,1571B 'ue</':1037B,1103B,1152B 'uently acc':1799B 'ues an':1004B 'ues:</':1190B 'ues</l':1271B 'uire lo':1063B 'uired</l':1289B 'ul':1925B 'ult cur':1583B,1620B 'ult</t':876B 'um':2497B,2531B 'um ri':1764B 'um-ter':1526B 'ummary<':21B 'uo':1901B 'up dur':1781B 'up in':1505B 'up</st':1734B 'ure (en, ':2346B 'ures\n-- ':1669B 'ures</h4':2025B 'urrency</st':1706B 'us':632B,683B,1106B,2474B,2597B 'us (st':1596B 'us&quo':1904B 'us)\n);':1597B 'us</t':608B 'use':1373B,1587B,1638B 'use.ht':2738B 'user':2225B 'userfromdb(us':1832B 'ux)</':2659B 'uz':1930B 've\n  }\n':2160B 've log':1320B 've r':1514B 've&quo':1907B 've(resu':2232B 've, rej':2198B 'very</li':1739B 'ves':2658B 'vior tra':2061B 'vs-mysql-':2756B 'w':2734B,2749B 'w pa':1041B 'w<':2547B 'w</l':1074B 'w</str':2788B 'wth po':490B 'x fas':1692B 'x idx':1586B,1590B,1594B,1637B,1642B 'x(`us':1836B 'xceed ':75B 'xecutive ':20B 'xed qu':1689B 'xed str':1446B 'xing</h4':1873B 'xing</li':1941B 'xt ':2786B 'y mat':1931B 'y matrix':2432B 'y per':1363B 'y re':1123B 'y&quo':1889B 'y-to':1121B 'y-to-ma':1120B 'y</h2>\n':2301B 'y</th>\n<':2442B 'ysis</li':1990B 'ytics da':2056B 'ytics</h4':2051B 'zation for q':2394B 'ze':2662B 'ze ':113B 'ze</':123B 'zlib.crea':2274B,2294B '{\n':1815B '⚠️':1003B,2416B '⚠️ act':2799B '✅ ':859B,893B,914B,934B,954B,980B,985B,989B,994B '관리':759B,829B,839B '관리자':2802C '분석':789B '사원</s':771B,800B '이사':809B '자동':770B '체 관리':819B '💡 ':1293B '🔴 ':2478B '🟡':2527B '🟢':2546B	2025-11-24 18:11:29.613+00	2025-11-24 18:11:29.613+00	2025-11-24 18:11:29.613+00	\N	f	\N	\N	unanswered	\N	\N	\N	0	\N
a61f7a2c-2852-4f9d-883d-22f8aef136b5	78516af9-bd41-4d98-a553-f64dfa9eef5e	Backend API Routes (Next.js Serverless Functions)	<h1>Backend API Routes (Next.js Serverless Functions)</h1>\n<h2>✅ Backend가 Vercel에서 실행됩니다!</h2>\n<p>이 애플리케이션은 이제 <strong>Next.js API Routes</strong>를 사용하여 백엔드 기능을 제공합니다. 별도의 Express 서버를 배포할 필요가 없습니다!</p>\n<h2>🚀 작동 방식</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>프론트엔드</strong>: <code>https://your-app.vercel.app</code></li>\n<li><strong>백엔드 API</strong>: <code>https://your-app.vercel.app/api/*</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>모든 API 엔드포인트가 Vercel Serverless Functions로 자동 배포됩니다.</p>\n<h2>📋 구현된 API Routes</h2>\n<h3>Authentication (<code>/api/auth/*</code>)</h3>\n<h4>POST <code>/api/auth/login</code></h4>\n<p>사용자 로그인</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Body</strong>: <code>{ username, password }</code></li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>{ token, refreshToken, user }</code> 또는 <code>{ mfaRequired, userId, email }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>POST <code>/api/auth/verify-mfa</code></h4>\n<p>MFA 코드 검증</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Body</strong>: <code>{ userId, code }</code></li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>{ token, refreshToken, user }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>POST <code>/api/auth/refresh</code></h4>\n<p>액세스 토큰 갱신</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Body</strong>: <code>{ refreshToken }</code></li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>{ token }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>POST <code>/api/auth/logout</code></h4>\n<p>로그아웃</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Headers</strong>: <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>{ message }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Menu Management (<code>/api/menu</code>)</h3>\n<h4>GET <code>/api/menu</code></h4>\n<p>모든 메뉴 조회</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Headers</strong>: <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>[ { menu objects } ]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>POST <code>/api/menu</code></h4>\n<p>새 메뉴 생성 (Admin only)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Headers</strong>: <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Body</strong>: <code>{ menu data }</code></li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>{ new menu }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>PUT <code>/api/menu</code></h4>\n<p>메뉴 업데이트 (Admin only)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Headers</strong>: <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Body</strong>: <code>{ id, ...updates }</code></li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>{ updated menu }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>DELETE <code>/api/menu?id={menuId}</code></h4>\n<p>메뉴 삭제 (Admin only)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Headers</strong>: <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Query</strong>: <code>id</code></li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>{ message }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>User Management (<code>/api/user</code>)</h3>\n<h4>GET <code>/api/user</code></h4>\n<p>사용자 목록 조회 (필터링 &amp; 페이지네이션)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Headers</strong>: <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Query Parameters</strong>:<ul>\n<li><code>page</code>: 페이지 번호 (default: 0)</li>\n<li><code>pageSize</code>: 페이지 크기 (default: 50)</li>\n<li><code>username</code>: 사용자명 필터</li>\n<li><code>name</code>: 이름 필터</li>\n<li><code>email</code>: 이메일 필터</li>\n<li><code>role</code>: 역할 필터</li>\n<li><code>department</code>: 부서 필터</li>\n<li><code>status</code>: 상태 필터</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>{ users, total, page, pageSize }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>POST <code>/api/user</code></h4>\n<p>새 사용자 생성 (Admin only)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Headers</strong>: <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Body</strong>: <code>{ username, password, name, email, role, department, ... }</code></li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>{ new user }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>PUT <code>/api/user</code></h4>\n<p>사용자 업데이트 (Admin only)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Headers</strong>: <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Body</strong>: <code>{ id, ...updates }</code></li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>{ updated user }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>DELETE <code>/api/user?id={userId}</code></h4>\n<p>사용자 삭제 (Admin only)</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Headers</strong>: <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code></li>\n<li><strong>Query</strong>: <code>id</code></li>\n<li><strong>Response</strong>: <code>{ message }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🗄️ 데이터 저장</h2>\n<h3>Development (로컬)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>데이터는 <code>backend/data/*.json</code> 파일에 저장됩니다</li>\n<li>파일: <code>users.json</code>, <code>menus.json</code>, <code>mfaCodes.json</code> 등</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Production (Vercel)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>데이터는 <code>/tmp/data/</code> 디렉토리에 임시 저장됩니다</li>\n<li>⚠️ <strong>중요</strong>: Vercel의 <code>/tmp</code>는 서버리스 함수 실행 간에 지속되지 않을 수 있습니다</li>\n<li>프로덕션 환경에서는 다음을 권장합니다:<ul>\n<li><strong>Vercel KV</strong> (Redis)</li>\n<li><strong>Vercel Postgres</strong></li>\n<li><strong>MongoDB Atlas</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Supabase</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔐 인증</h2>\n<p>모든 보호된 엔드포인트는 JWT Bearer 토큰이 필요합니다:</p>\n<pre><code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;your-jwt-token&gt;\n</code></pre>\n<h2>📦 환경 변수</h2>\n<p>Vercel Dashboard에서 다음 환경 변수를 설정하세요:</p>\n<h3>필수 변수</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-bash"># API 설정 (Next.js API Routes 사용)\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api\n\n# JWT Secrets\nJWT_SECRET=&lt;your-secure-secret-key&gt;\nJWT_REFRESH_SECRET=&lt;your-secure-refresh-key&gt;\n\n# Session Configuration\nSESSION_TIMEOUT=1800000\nSESSION_WARNING_TIME=120000\n</code></pre>\n<h3>시크릿 키 생성</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-bash">node -e &quot;console.log(require(&#39;crypto&#39;).randomBytes(64).toString(&#39;hex&#39;))&quot;\n</code></pre>\n<h2>🔄 Migration from Express Backend</h2>\n<h3>이전 구조 (Express)</h3>\n<pre><code>backend/\n  ├── server.js (Express 서버)\n  ├── routes/ (API 라우트)\n  └── data/ (JSON 데이터)\n</code></pre>\n<h3>새로운 구조 (Next.js API Routes)</h3>\n<pre><code>src/\n  ├── app/api/ (API Routes - Serverless Functions)\n  │   ├── auth/\n  │   │   ├── login/route.ts\n  │   │   ├── verify-mfa/route.ts\n  │   │   ├── refresh/route.ts\n  │   │   └── logout/route.ts\n  │   ├── menu/route.ts\n  │   └── user/route.ts\n  └── lib/api/ (Utility Functions)\n      ├── jwt.ts\n      ├── password.ts\n      └── fileUtils.ts\n</code></pre>\n<h2>✨ 장점</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>별도 서버 불필요</strong>: Express 백엔드를 따로 배포할 필요 없음</li>\n<li><strong>자동 확장</strong>: Vercel이 자동으로 확장 처리</li>\n<li><strong>빠른 배포</strong>: 프론트엔드와 백엔드가 함께 배포됨</li>\n<li><strong>동일 도메인</strong>: CORS 문제 없음</li>\n<li><strong>비용 효율적</strong>: 서버리스 요금제</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>🚦 API 사용 예시</h2>\n<h3>로그인</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-typescript">const response = await fetch(&#39;/api/auth/login&#39;, {\n  method: &#39;POST&#39;,\n  headers: { &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;application/json&#39; },\n  body: JSON.stringify({ username: &#39;admin&#39;, password: &#39;admin123&#39; })\n});\nconst data = await response.json();\n</code></pre>\n<h3>메뉴 조회</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-typescript">const response = await fetch(&#39;/api/menu&#39;, {\n  headers: { &#39;Authorization&#39;: `Bearer ${token}` }\n});\nconst menus = await response.json();\n</code></pre>\n<h3>사용자 목록 (필터링)</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-typescript">const response = await fetch(&#39;/api/user?page=0&amp;pageSize=10&amp;role=admin&#39;, {\n  headers: { &#39;Authorization&#39;: `Bearer ${token}` }\n});\nconst { users, total } = await response.json();\n</code></pre>\n<h2>🧪 로컬 테스트</h2>\n<pre><code class="language-bash"># 개발 서버 시작\nnpm run dev\n\n# API 테스트\ncurl http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login \\\n  -X POST \\\n  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \\\n  -d &#39;{&quot;username&quot;:&quot;admin&quot;,&quot;password&quot;:&quot;admin123&quot;}&#39;\n</code></pre>\n<h2>📚 추가 정보</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Next.js API Routes: <a href="https://nextjs.org/docs/app/building-your-application/routing/route-handlers">https://nextjs.org/docs/app/building-your-application/routing/route-handlers</a></li>\n<li>Vercel Serverless Functions: <a href="https://vercel.com/docs/functions/serverless-functions">https://vercel.com/docs/functions/serverless-functions</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⚠️ 제한사항</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>파일 저장소</strong>: JSON 파일은 임시적입니다. 프로덕션에서는 데이터베이스 사용 권장</li>\n<li><strong>실행 시간</strong>: Serverless 함수는 최대 10초(Hobby), 60초(Pro) 제한</li>\n<li><strong>메모리</strong>: 1024MB(Hobby), 3008MB(Pro) 제한</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>🎯 프로덕션 권장사항</h2>\n<p>프로덕션 환경에서는 다음을 고려하세요:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>데이터베이스 연결</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vercel Postgres</li>\n<li>MongoDB Atlas</li>\n<li>Supabase</li>\n<li>PlanetScale</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>파일 스토리지</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vercel Blob</li>\n<li>AWS S3</li>\n<li>Cloudinary</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>캐싱</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vercel KV (Redis)</li>\n<li>Next.js caching</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>모니터링</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vercel Analytics</li>\n<li>Sentry</li>\n<li>LogRocket</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n	1	관리자	IT	f	normal	published	f	\N	f	t	\N	\N	0	0	0	0	[]	{}	'\n':97B,138B,172B,201B,243B,280B,325B,372B,425B,532B,581B,628B,946B,955B,964B,972B,1123B '\n  ':926B '\n# ':1112B '\n<':662B,666B,667B,677B,693B,694B,698B,699B,709B,727B,733B,740B,746B,752B,757B,758B,759B,760B,985B,1034B,1200B,1238B '\n</c':865B,1031B,1059B,1098B '\n</ul':1286B,1304B,1323B '\n<h':783B '\n<li>':1261B,1317B '\n<ol':1203B '\n<ol>':1246B '\n<p':1101B '\nn':1108B ' ':763B '  ':910B,913B,915B,917B,919B,927B,929B,1003B,1015B,1048B,1086B '  -d':1132B '  -x ':1122B '  │ ':908B ' &#39;':1004B ' (':277B,369B,421B,450B,459B,529B,625B ' (n':892B ' - ser':905B ' -h ':1124B ' <':117B,679B ' = aw':1095B ' a':1259B ' awai':1056B ' c':1302B ' ht':1115B ' r':895B ' s':1182B ' user':1093B ' }\n})':1054B,1092B ' └─':887B ' ├─':901B ' 갱':170B ' 검':136B ' 구':891B ' 권':1240B ' 권장':731B ' 권장</l':1215B ' 다음을':1244B ' 메':240B ' 백엔드가 ':962B ' 변':788B,793B ' 삭':368B ' 생':276B ' 생성':843B ' 시간</s':1219B ' 업':321B ' 없음':945B ' 저장':660B,675B ' 저장소</':1207B ' 조':241B,420B ' 테':1100B ' 프':1239B ' 필':474B,488B,495B,502B,944B ' 환':784B '">https:/':1193B '# '