tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><a href="./VERCEL_DATA_INITIALIZATION.md">VERCEL_DATA_INITIALIZATION.md</a></strong></td>\n<td>Vercel 데이터 초기화 가이드</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><a href="./DEPLOY_SUMMARY.md">DEPLOY_SUMMARY.md</a></strong></td>\n<td>배포 빠른 참조 체크리스트</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>📝 기타 문서</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>문서</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong><a href="./IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md">IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md</a></strong></td>\n<td>구현 요약 및 기술 스택</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><a href="./PAGE_TEMPLATES.md">PAGE_TEMPLATES.md</a></strong></td>\n<td>페이지 템플릿 및 컴포넌트</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><a href="./PR_CONTENT.md">PR_CONTENT.md</a></strong></td>\n<td>Pull Request 템플릿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2>🎯 상황별 가이드</h2>\n<h3>처음 시작하는 경우</h3>\n<pre><code>1. README.md (프로젝트 개요)\n2. LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md (개발 환경 설정)\n3. FEATURES.md (기능 둘러보기)\n</code></pre>\n<h3>로컬 개발 설정</h3>\n<pre><code>1. LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md (전체 가이드)\n2. LOCAL_DEV_SUMMARY.md (빠른 참조)\n</code></pre>\n<h3>Backend 이해하기</h3>\n<pre><code>1. BACKEND_SOLUTION.md (솔루션 개요)\n2. BACKEND_API_ROUTES.md (API 문서)\n</code></pre>\n<h3>배포하기</h3>\n<pre><code>1. DOCKER_DEPLOYMENT.md (Docker 배포 - 모든 환경)\n2. VERCEL_DEPLOYMENT.md (Vercel 배포 - 서버리스)\n3. VERCEL_DATA_INITIALIZATION.md (데이터 초기화)\n4. DEPLOY_SUMMARY.md (체크리스트)\n</code></pre>\n<h3>아키텍처 이해</h3>\n<pre><code>1. ARCHITECTURE.md (전체 아키텍처)\n2. PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md (구조 설명)\n3. IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md (기술 스택)\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2>🔍 빠른 검색</h2>\n<h3>로컬 개발</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Express Backend 사용: <a href="./LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md#option-2-express-backend-%EB%A0%88%EA%B1%B0%EC%8B%9C">LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md</a></li>\n<li>Next.js API Routes 사용: <a href="./LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md#option-1-nextjs-api-routes-%EA%B6%8C%EC%9E%A5">LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md</a></li>\n<li>환경 변수 설정: <a href="./LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md#%ED%99%98%EA%B2%BD-%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95-%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC">LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>API 개발</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>인증 API: <a href