539cf4de-477f-4871-afda-1ea89837768e	78516af9-bd41-4d98-a553-f64dfa9eef5e	MSA 전환 실행 계획서	<h1><strong>MSA 전환 실행 계획서</strong></h1><blockquote><p>작성일: 2024-12-08 버전: 1.0 상태: Draft</p></blockquote><hr><h2><strong>목차</strong></h2><ol><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/msa-migration-plan.md#1-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%A0%9D%ED%8A%B8-%EA%B0%9C%EC%9A%94">프로젝트 개요</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/msa-migration-plan.md#2-%EB%AA%A9%ED%91%9C-%EC%95%84%ED%82%A4%ED%85%8D%EC%B2%98">목표 아키텍처</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/msa-migration-plan.md#3-%EA%B8%B0%EC%88%A0-%EC%8A%A4%ED%83%9D-%EA%B2%B0%EC%A0%95">기술 스택 결정</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/msa-migration-plan.md#4-%EC%84%9C%EB%B9%84%EC%8A%A4-%EB%B6%84%EB%A6%AC-%EC%83%81%EC%84%B8">서비스 분리 상세</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/msa-migration-plan.md#5-frontend-%EC%9A%B4%EC%98%81-%EC%A0%84%EB%9E%B5">Frontend 운영 전략</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/msa-migration-plan.md#6-%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%B4%EA%B7%B8%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%EC%85%98-%EC%A0%84%EB%9E%B5">마이그레이션 전략</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/msa-migration-plan.md#7-%EC%9D%B8%ED%94%84%EB%9D%BC-%EA%B5%AC%EC%84%B1">인프라 구성</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/msa-migration-plan.md#8-%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89-%EC%9D%BC%EC%A0%95">실행 일정</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/msa-migration-plan.md#9-%EA%B2%80%ED%86%A0-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%9D%98%EC%82%AC%EA%B2%B0%EC%A0%95-%ED%95%84%EC%9A%94%EC%82%AC%ED%95%AD">검토 및 의사결정 필요사항</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/msa-migration-plan.md#10-%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC-%EA%B4%80%EB%A6%AC">리스크 관리</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/msa-migration-plan.md#%EB%B6%80%EB%A1%9D">부록</a></p></li></ol><hr><h2><strong>1. 프로젝트 개요</strong></h2><h3><strong>1.1 현재 상태</strong></h3><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              현재 모놀리식 구조              │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Frontend (Next.js)     │  Port: 3000       │\n│  Backend (Express.js)   │  Port: 3001       │\n│  Database (PostgreSQL)  │  Port: 9090       │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Backend 구성:                               │\n│  - 26개 API 라우트                           │\n│  - 20개 비즈니스 서비스                       │\n│  - 단일 데이터베이스 연결                     │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h3><strong>1.2 전환 목표</strong></h3><ul><li><p>비즈니스 도메인별 독립 서비스 운영</p></li><li><p>개별 서비스의 독립적 배포/확장</p></li><li><p>장애 격리 및 시스템 안정성 향상</p></li><li><p>새로운 비즈니스 기능의 유연한 추가</p></li></ul><h3><strong>1.3 제약 조건</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>항목</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>결정</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Load Balancer</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Nginx</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>API Gateway</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Apache APISIX</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Container Orchestration</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Docker Compose</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Database</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>현상태 유지 (단일 PostgreSQL)</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2><strong>2. 목표 아키텍처</strong></h2><h3><strong>2.1 전체 구조도</strong></h3><pre><code>                         ┌─────────────────────────┐\n                         │      Client (Browser)   │\n                         └───────────┬─────────────┘\n                                     │\n                         ┌───────────▼─────────────┐\n                         │    Nginx Load Balancer  │\n                         │    (SSL Termination)    │\n                         │    Port: 80/443         │\n                         └───────────┬─────────────┘\n                                     │\n              ┌──────────────────────┼──────────────────────┐\n              │                      │                      │\n   ┌──────────▼──────────┐ ┌────────▼────────┐             │\n   │   Frontend (Next.js) │ │  Apache APISIX  │             │\n   │   Port: 3000         │ │  (API Gateway)  │             │\n   │                      │ │  Port: 9080     │             │\n   └──────────────────────┘ └────────┬────────┘             │\n                                     │                      │\n         ┌───────────┬───────────┬───┴───┬───────────┐      │\n         │           │           │       │           │      │\n   ┌─────▼─────┐ ┌───▼───┐ ┌─────▼─────┐ ┌▼─────┐ ┌──▼──┐  │\n   │   Auth    │ │ Admin │ │  Content  │ │ Comm │ │Common│  │\n   │  Service  │ │Service│ │  Service  │ │Service│ │Service│ │\n   │  :3011    │ │ :3012 │ │   :3013   │ │:3014 │ │:3015 │  │\n   └─────┬─────┘ └───┬───┘ └─────┬─────┘ └──┬───┘ └──┬──┘  │\n         │           │           │          │        │      │\n         └───────────┴───────────┴────┬─────┴────────┘      │\n                                      │                     │\n                         ┌────────────▼────────────┐        │\n                         │   PostgreSQL Database   │        │\n                         │   (기존 유지)            │        │\n                         │   Port: 9090            │        │\n                         └─────────────────────────┘        │\n                                                            │\n                         ┌──────────────────────────────────┘\n                         │\n              ┌──────────▼──────────┐\n              │   Redis (Optional)  │\n              │   - Session Store   │\n              │   - Cache           │\n              │   Port: 6379        │\n              └─────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h3><strong>2.2 포트 할당 계획</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 75px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>서비스</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>포트</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>설명</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Nginx</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>80, 443</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>External Load Balancer</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>9080</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>API Gateway</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX Admin</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>9180</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX 관리 API</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>etcd</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>2379</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX 설정 저장소</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Frontend</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>3000</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Next.js</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Auth Service</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>3011</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>인증 서비스</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Admin Service</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>3012</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>관리 서비스</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Content Service</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>3013</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>콘텐츠 서비스</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Communication Service</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>3014</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>커뮤니케이션 서비스</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Common Service</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>3015</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>공통 서비스</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>PostgreSQL</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>9090</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Database (기존)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Redis</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>6379</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Cache/Session (선택)</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2><strong>3. 기술 스택 결정</strong></h2><h3><strong>3.1 인프라 컴포넌트</strong></h3><h4><strong>Nginx (Load Balancer)</strong></h4><p><strong>선정 이유:</strong></p><ul><li><p>검증된 안정성과 고성능</p></li><li><p>SSL Termination 지원</p></li><li><p>유연한 설정</p></li><li><p>풍부한 문서와 커뮤니티</p></li></ul><p><strong>주요 역할:</strong></p><ul><li><p>SSL/TLS 종단점</p></li><li><p>Static 파일 서빙 (선택적)</p></li><li><p>Health Check</p></li><li><p>기본 로드밸런싱</p></li></ul><h4><strong>Apache APISIX (API Gateway)</strong></h4><p><strong>선정 이유:</strong></p><ul><li><p>고성능 (OpenResty/Nginx 기반)</p></li><li><p>풍부한 플러그인 생태계</p></li><li><p>동적 라우팅 설정 (Hot reload)</p></li><li><p>Dashboard UI 제공</p></li><li><p>Kubernetes/Docker 친화적</p></li></ul><p><strong>주요 역할:</strong></p><ul><li><p>API 라우팅</p></li><li><p>인증/인가 (JWT 검증)</p></li><li><p>Rate Limiting</p></li><li><p>Request/Response 변환</p></li><li><p>로깅 및 모니터링</p></li></ul><p><strong>APISIX vs Kong 비교:</strong></p><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 75px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>항목</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Kong</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>성능</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>매우 높음</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>높음</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>설정 방식</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>etcd (동적)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>PostgreSQL</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>학습 곡선</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중간</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>낮음</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>라이선스</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Apache 2.0</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Apache 2.0</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>플러그인</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>80+</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>50+</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Dashboard</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>무료</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>유료 (Enterprise)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>한국 사용자</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>증가 중</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>많음</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>3.2 서비스 기술 스택</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 75px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>구분</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>기술</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>비고</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Runtime</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Node.js 20 LTS</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>기존 유지</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Framework</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Express.js 4.x</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>기존 유지</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Language</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>TypeScript</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>기존 유지</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Database Client</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>pg-promise</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>기존 유지</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Container</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Docker</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>신규</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Orchestration</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Docker Compose</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>신규</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>3.3 공유 라이브러리</strong></h3><pre><code>shared/\n├── types/           # 공통 TypeScript 타입\n├── utils/           # 공통 유틸리티 함수\n├── constants/       # 공통 상수\n├── middleware/      # 공통 미들웨어\n│   ├── auth.ts      # JWT 검증 (로컬 검증)\n│   ├── logger.ts    # 로깅\n│   └── errorHandler.ts\n└── config/          # 공통 설정\n    └── database.ts  # DB 연결 설정\n</code></pre><hr><h2><strong>4. 서비스 분리 상세</strong></h2><h3><strong>4.1 Auth Service (인증 서비스)</strong></h3><h4><strong>책임 범위</strong></h4><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              Auth Service                    │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  API Endpoints:                              │\n│  ├── POST /auth/login                        │\n│  ├── POST /auth/logout                       │\n│  ├── POST /auth/refresh                      │\n│  ├── POST /auth/verify-mfa                   │\n│  ├── POST /auth/send-mfa                     │\n│  ├── POST /auth/sso                          │\n│  ├── GET  /auth/validate (internal)          │\n│  └── GET  /auth/me                           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Database Tables:                            │\n│  ├── users (id, loginid, password, mfa_*)    │\n│  ├── sessions                                │\n│  ├── refresh_tokens                          │\n│  └── login_history                           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Dependencies:                               │\n│  ├── Redis (Session Store) - Optional        │\n│  └── SMTP (MFA 이메일)                        │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h4><strong>마이그레이션 대상 파일</strong></h4><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>현재 위치</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>마이그레이션 위치</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/auth.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/auth-service/src/routes/auth.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/authService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/auth-service/src/services/authService.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/utils/jwt.ts</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/auth-service/src/utils/jwt.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/utils/password.ts</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/auth-service/src/utils/password.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/middleware/auth.ts</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>shared/middleware/auth.ts</code> (공유)</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4><strong>API 스펙</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-yaml"># Auth Service API\nbasePath: /auth\n\nendpoints:\n  login:\n    method: POST\n    path: /login\n    request:\n      body:\n        loginid: string\n        password: string\n    response:\n      token: string\n      refreshToken: string\n      user: UserBasic\n      mfaRequired: boolean\n\n  validate:\n    method: GET\n    path: /validate\n    description: "내부 서비스용 토큰 검증"\n    headers:\n      Authorization: Bearer {token}\n    response:\n      valid: boolean\n      user: UserBasic\n</code></pre><hr><h3><strong>4.2 Admin Service (관리 서비스)</strong></h3><h4><strong>책임 범위</strong></h4><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              Admin Service                   │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  API Endpoints:                              │\n│  ├── /admin/users/*                          │\n│  ├── /admin/roles/*                          │\n│  ├── /admin/departments/*                    │\n│  ├── /admin/menus/*                          │\n│  ├── /admin/programs/*                       │\n│  ├── /admin/user-role-mappings/*             │\n│  ├── /admin/role-menu-mappings/*             │\n│  └── /admin/role-program-mappings/*          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Database Tables:                            │\n│  ├── users (프로필 필드)                      │\n│  ├── roles                                   │\n│  ├── departments                             │\n│  ├── menus                                   │\n│  ├── programs                                │\n│  ├── user_role_mappings                      │\n│  ├── role_menu_mappings                      │\n│  └── role_program_mappings                   │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h4><strong>마이그레이션 대상 파일</strong></h4><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>현재 위치</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>마이그레이션 위치</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/user.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/routes/user.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/role.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/routes/role.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/department.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/routes/department.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/menu.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/routes/menu.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/program.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/routes/program.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/userRoleMapping.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/routes/userRoleMapping.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/roleMenuMapping.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/routes/roleMenuMapping.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/roleProgramMapping.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/routes/roleProgramMapping.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/userService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/services/userService.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/roleService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/services/roleService.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/departmentService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/services/departmentService.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/menuService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/admin-service/src/services/menuService.ts</code></p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h3><strong>4.3 Content Service (콘텐츠 서비스)</strong></h3><h4><strong>책임 범위</strong></h4><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│             Content Service                  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  API Endpoints:                              │\n│  ├── /content/board-types/*                  │\n│  ├── /content/posts/*                        │\n│  ├── /content/comments/*                     │\n│  ├── /content/qna/*                          │\n│  └── /content/help/*                         │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Database Tables:                            │\n│  ├── board_types                             │\n│  ├── posts                                   │\n│  ├── comments                                │\n│  ├── qna                                     │\n│  └── help                                    │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Dependencies:                               │\n│  └── Common Service (첨부파일)               │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h4><strong>마이그레이션 대상 파일</strong></h4><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>현재 위치</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>마이그레이션 위치</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/boardType.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/content-service/src/routes/boardType.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/post.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/content-service/src/routes/post.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/comment.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/content-service/src/routes/comment.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/qna.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/content-service/src/routes/qna.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/help.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/content-service/src/routes/help.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/boardTypeService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/content-service/src/services/boardTypeService.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/postService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/content-service/src/services/postService.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/commentService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/content-service/src/services/commentService.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/helpService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/content-service/src/services/helpService.ts</code></p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h3><strong>4.4 Communication Service (커뮤니케이션 서비스)</strong></h3><h4><strong>책임 범위</strong></h4><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│          Communication Service               │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  API Endpoints:                              │\n│  ├── /comm/mail/*                            │\n│  ├── /comm/messages/*                        │\n│  └── /comm/notifications/* (향후)            │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Database Tables:                            │\n│  ├── mail_messages                           │\n│  ├── mail_user_messages                      │\n│  ├── mail_attachments                        │\n│  ├── messages                                │\n│  └── notifications (향후)                    │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Dependencies:                               │\n│  ├── Admin Service (수신자 정보)             │\n│  └── Common Service (첨부파일)               │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h4><strong>마이그레이션 대상 파일</strong></h4><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>현재 위치</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>마이그레이션 위치</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/mail.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/communication-service/src/routes/mail.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/message.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/communication-service/src/routes/message.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/mailService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/communication-service/src/services/mailService.ts</code></p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h3><strong>4.5 Common Service (공통 서비스)</strong></h3><h4><strong>책임 범위</strong></h4><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              Common Service                  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  API Endpoints:                              │\n│  ├── /common/codes/*                         │\n│  ├── /common/code-types/*                    │\n│  ├── /common/attachments/*                   │\n│  ├── /common/attachment-types/*              │\n│  ├── /common/logs/*                          │\n│  ├── /common/settings/*                      │\n│  └── /common/dashboard/*                     │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Database Tables:                            │\n│  ├── codes                                   │\n│  ├── code_types                              │\n│  ├── attachments                             │\n│  ├── attachment_types                        │\n│  ├── logs                                    │\n│  └── app_settings                            │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  File Storage:                               │\n│  └── /uploads/* (첨부파일 저장소)            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h4><strong>마이그레이션 대상 파일</strong></h4><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>현재 위치</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>마이그레이션 위치</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/code.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/common-service/src/routes/code.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/codeType.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/common-service/src/routes/codeType.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/attachment.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/common-service/src/routes/attachment.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/attachmentType.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/common-service/src/routes/attachmentType.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/log.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/common-service/src/routes/log.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/appSettings.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/common-service/src/routes/appSettings.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/routes/dashboard.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/common-service/src/routes/dashboard.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/codeService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/common-service/src/services/codeService.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/attachmentService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/common-service/src/services/attachmentService.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/logService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/common-service/src/services/logService.ts</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>backend/services/appSettingsService.js</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>services/common-service/src/services/appSettingsService.ts</code></p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2><strong>5. Frontend 운영 전략</strong></h2><h3><strong>5.1 분석</strong></h3><h4><strong>현재 Frontend 구조</strong></h4><pre><code>src/\n├── app/[locale]/          # 페이지 (App Router)\n│   ├── admin/            # 관리자 페이지\n│   ├── boards/           # 게시판 페이지\n│   ├── dashboard/        # 대시보드\n│   ├── mail/             # 메일\n│   └── login/            # 로그인\n├── components/            # 86개 컴포넌트 디렉토리\n├── contexts/              # 3개 Context\n├── hooks/                 # 14개 Custom Hooks\n├── lib/                   # 유틸리티\n└── types/                 # 타입 정의\n</code></pre><h3><strong>5.2 운영 전략 옵션</strong></h3><h4><strong>Option A: 단일 Frontend 유지 (권장)</strong></h4><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│           Single Frontend (Next.js)          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  장점:                                       │\n│  • 공통 컴포넌트/테마 재사용                  │\n│  • 일관된 UX                                 │\n│  • 배포 단순화                               │\n│  • SEO 관리 용이                             │\n│  • 상태 관리 단순                            │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  단점:                                       │\n│  • 빌드 시간 증가 (규모 확장 시)             │\n│  • 단일 장애점                               │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><p><strong>API 호출 구조:</strong></p><pre><code class="language-typescript">// lib/axios/index.ts 수정\nconst api = axios.create({\n  baseURL: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_API_GATEWAY_URL, // APISIX\n  // ...\n});\n\n// 기존: /api/auth/login\n// 변경: /auth/login (APISIX가 라우팅)\n</code></pre><h4><strong>Option B: Micro Frontend (향후 검토)</strong></h4><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│           Micro Frontend 구조               │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  Shell App (메인)                            │\n│  ├── Admin Module (관리자)                   │\n│  ├── Content Module (게시판)                 │\n│  ├── Mail Module (메일)                      │\n│  └── Dashboard Module (대시보드)             │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  장점:                                       │\n│  • 독립 배포                                 │\n│  • 팀별 독립 개발                            │\n│  • 기술 스택 유연성                          │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  단점:                                       │\n│  • 구현 복잡도 높음                          │\n│  • 런타임 통합 오버헤드                      │\n│  • 공통 상태 관리 어려움                     │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h3><strong>5.3 권장 전략</strong></h3><p><strong>Phase 1-3: 단일 Frontend 유지</strong></p><ul><li><p>API Base URL만 변경 (APISIX 경유)</p></li><li><p>기존 컴포넌트/상태 관리 유지</p></li><li><p>빠른 MSA 전환 가능</p></li></ul><p><strong>Phase 4+ (선택적): Micro Frontend 검토</strong></p><ul><li><p>조건: Frontend 규모가 매우 커지거나 팀이 분리될 경우</p></li><li><p>기술: Module Federation (Webpack 5) 또는 Single-SPA</p></li></ul><h3><strong>5.4 Frontend 코드 변경 사항</strong></h3><h4><strong>API 경로 변경 매핑</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-typescript">// 현재 → 변경\n'/api/auth/*'        → '/auth/*'\n'/api/user/*'        → '/admin/users/*'\n'/api/role/*'        → '/admin/roles/*'\n'/api/menu/*'        → '/admin/menus/*'\n'/api/department/*'  → '/admin/departments/*'\n'/api/program/*'     → '/admin/programs/*'\n'/api/board-type/*'  → '/content/board-types/*'\n'/api/post/*'        → '/content/posts/*'\n'/api/comment/*'     → '/content/comments/*'\n'/api/qna/*'         → '/content/qna/*'\n'/api/help/*'        → '/content/help/*'\n'/api/mail/*'        → '/comm/mail/*'\n'/api/message/*'     → '/comm/messages/*'\n'/api/code/*'        → '/common/codes/*'\n'/api/attachment/*'  → '/common/attachments/*'\n'/api/log/*'         → '/common/logs/*'\n'/api/app-settings/*'→ '/common/settings/*'\n'/api/dashboard/*'   → '/common/dashboard/*'\n</code></pre><h4><strong>Axios 설정 변경</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-typescript">// src/lib/axios/index.ts\n\n// Before\nconst api = axios.create({\n  baseURL: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL || 'http://localhost:3001/api',\n});\n\n// After\nconst api = axios.create({\n  baseURL: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_API_GATEWAY_URL || 'http://localhost:9080',\n});\n</code></pre><hr><h2><strong>6. 마이그레이션 전략</strong></h2><h3><strong>6.1 전략: Strangler Fig Pattern</strong></h3><p>기존 모놀리식을 유지하면서 점진적으로 서비스를 분리하여 리스크 최소화</p><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    Strangler Fig Pattern                         │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                  │\n│  Phase 1          Phase 2          Phase 3          Phase 4     │\n│  ┌──────┐        ┌──────┐         ┌──────┐         ┌──────┐    │\n│  │Mono  │        │Mono  │         │ Auth │         │ Auth │    │\n│  │lithic│   →    ├──────┤    →    ├──────┤    →    ├──────┤    │\n│  │      │        │ Auth │         │Admin │         │Admin │    │\n│  │      │        │Service│        │Service│        ├──────┤    │\n│  │      │        │      │         ├──────┤         │Content│   │\n│  │      │        │      │         │Mono  │         ├──────┤    │\n│  │      │        │      │         │(rest)│         │ Comm │    │\n│  │      │        │      │         │      │         ├──────┤    │\n│  └──────┘        └──────┘         └──────┘         │Common│    │\n│                                                    └──────┘    │\n│                                                                  │\n│  인프라 구축      Auth 분리        Admin 분리      전체 분리     │\n│  APISIX 설정     토큰검증 이관    권한체계 이관    완전 MSA      │\n│                                                                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h3><strong>6.2 단계별 상세 계획</strong></h3><h4><strong>Phase 0: 사전 준비 (1주)</strong></h4><p><strong>목표:</strong> 인프라 기반 구축 및 개발 환경 설정</p><p><strong>작업 내용:</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>디렉토리 구조 생성</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-bash">mkdir -p services/{auth,admin,content,communication,common}-service/src/{routes,services,middleware,utils,config}\nmkdir -p shared/{types,utils,constants,middleware,config}\nmkdir -p infrastructure/{nginx,apisix,docker}\nmkdir -p docs/api-contracts\n</code></pre><ol start="2"><li><p><strong>Docker 환경 구성</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-yaml"># infrastructure/docker/docker-compose.base.yml\nversion: '3.8'\n\nservices:\n  nginx:\n    image: nginx:alpine\n    ports:\n      - "80:80"\n      - "443:443"\n    volumes:\n      - ../nginx/nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf\n    depends_on:\n      - apisix\n      - frontend\n\n  etcd:\n    image: bitnami/etcd:3.5\n    environment:\n      - ALLOW_Nyes\n    ports:\n      - "2379:2379"\n\n  apisix:\n    image: apache/apisix:3.8.0-debian\n    ports:\n      - "9080:9080"\n      - "9180:9180"\n    volumes:\n      - ../apisix/config.yaml:/usr/local/apisix/conf/config.yaml\n    depends_on:\n      - etcd\n\n  apisix-dashboard:\n    image: apache/apisix-dashboard:3.0.1-alpine\n    ports:\n      - "9000:9000"\n    volumes:\n      - ../apisix/dashboard.yaml:/usr/local/apisix-dashboard/conf/conf.yaml\n    depends_on:\n      - apisix\n</code></pre><ol start="3"><li><p><strong>APISIX 기본 설정</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-yaml"># infrastructure/apisix/config.yaml\napisix:\n  node_listen: 9080\n  admin_key:\n    - name: admin\n      key: your-admin-api-key\n      role: admin\n\ndeployment:\n  admin:\n    admin_listen:\n      ip: 0.0.0.0\n      port: 9180\n  etcd:\n    host:\n      - "http://etcd:2379"\n</code></pre><ol start="4"><li><p><strong>Nginx 설정</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-nginx"># infrastructure/nginx/nginx.conf\nupstream frontend {\n    server frontend:3000;\n}\n\nupstream apisix {\n    server apisix:9080;\n}\n\nserver {\n    listen 80;\n    server_name localhost;\n\n    # Frontend\n    location / {\n        proxy_pass http://frontend;\n        proxy_http_version 1.1;\n        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;\n        proxy_set_header Connection 'upgrade';\n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\n    }\n\n    # API Gateway\n    location /api/ {\n        rewrite ^/api/(.*)$ /$1 break;\n        proxy_pass http://apisix;\n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n    }\n}\n</code></pre><ol start="5"><li><p><strong>공유 라이브러리 설정</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-json">// shared/package.json\n{\n  "name": "@enterprise/shared",\n  "version": "1.0.0",\n  "main": "dist/index.js",\n  "types": "dist/index.d.ts",\n  "scripts": {\n    "build": "tsc",\n    "watch": "tsc -w"\n  }\n}\n</code></pre><p><strong>산출물:</strong></p><ul><li><p>[ ] 디렉토리 구조 생성</p></li><li><p>[ ] Docker Compose 기본 파일</p></li><li><p>[ ] APISIX 기본 설정</p></li><li><p>[ ] Nginx 기본 설정</p></li><li><p>[ ] shared 패키지 설정</p></li><li><p>[ ] 개발 환경 검증</p></li></ul><hr><h4><strong>Phase 1: 인프라 구축 및 기존 서비스 연동 (2주)</strong></h4><p><strong>목표:</strong> APISIX를 통한 기존 모놀리식 서비스 라우팅</p><p><strong>작업 내용:</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>APISIX Route 설정 (기존 Backend 연동)</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-yaml"># APISIX Admin API로 라우트 등록\n# POST http://localhost:9180/apisix/admin/routes\n\n# 모든 요청을 기존 Backend로 라우팅\n{\n  "uri": "/*",\n  "name": "legacy-backend",\n  "upstream": {\n    "type": "roundrobin",\n    "nodes": {\n      "host.docker.internal:3001": 1\n    }\n  },\n  "plugins": {\n    "proxy-rewrite": {\n      "regex_uri": ["^/(.*)$", "/api/$1"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n</code></pre><ol start="2"><li><p><strong>Frontend API URL 변경</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-typescript">// src/lib/axios/index.ts\nconst api = axios.create({\n  baseURL: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_API_GATEWAY_URL || 'http://localhost:9080',\n});\n</code></pre><ol start="3"><li><p><strong>Health Check 엔드포인트 추가</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-typescript">// backend/routes/health.js\nrouter.get('/health', (req, res) =&gt; {\n  res.json({ status: 'healthy', service: 'legacy-backend', timestamp: new Date() });\n});\n</code></pre><ol start="4"><li><p><strong>APISIX 플러그인 설정</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-yaml"># Rate Limiting\nplugins:\n  limit-req:\n    rate: 100\n    burst: 50\n    key: remote_addr\n\n  # JWT 검증 (준비)\n  jwt-auth:\n    key: "user-key"\n    secret: "${JWT_SECRET}"\n</code></pre><p><strong>검증:</strong></p><ul><li><p>[ ] Frontend → APISIX → Backend 통신 확인</p></li><li><p>[ ] 기존 모든 기능 정상 작동 확인</p></li><li><p>[ ] Health Check 동작 확인</p></li><li><p>[ ] 로그 수집 확인</p></li></ul><p><strong>산출물:</strong></p><ul><li><p>[ ] APISIX 라우팅 설정 완료</p></li><li><p>[ ] Frontend baseURL 변경</p></li><li><p>[ ] Health Check API</p></li><li><p>[ ] 통합 테스트 결과</p></li></ul><hr><h4><strong>Phase 2: Auth Service 분리 (2주)</strong></h4><p><strong>목표:</strong> 인증 서비스를 독립 마이크로서비스로 분리</p><p><strong>작업 내용:</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>Auth Service 프로젝트 생성</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-bash"># services/auth-service/package.json\n{\n  "name": "@enterprise/auth-service",\n  "version": "1.0.0",\n  "scripts": {\n    "dev": "ts-node-dev src/server.ts",\n    "build": "tsc",\n    "start": "node dist/server.js"\n  },\n  "dependencies": {\n    "express": "^4.21.0",\n    "jsonwebtoken": "^9.0.0",\n    "bcrypt": "^5.1.0",\n    "pg-promise": "^11.5.0",\n    "@enterprise/shared": "file:../../shared"\n  }\n}\n</code></pre><ol start="2"><li><p><strong>Auth Service 구현</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-typescript">// services/auth-service/src/server.ts\nimport express from 'express';\nimport cors from 'cors';\nimport authRoutes from './routes/auth';\nimport { errorHandler } from '@enterprise/shared/middleware';\n\nconst app = express();\n\napp.use(cors());\napp.use(express.json());\n\napp.use('/auth', authRoutes);\napp.use(errorHandler);\n\nconst PORT = process.env.PORT || 3011;\napp.listen(PORT, () =&gt; {\n  console.log(`Auth Service running on port ${PORT}`);\n});\n</code></pre><ol start="3"><li><p><strong>APISIX 라우팅 업데이트</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-yaml"># Auth Service Route\n{\n  "uri": "/auth/*",\n  "name": "auth-service",\n  "upstream": {\n    "type": "roundrobin",\n    "nodes": {\n      "auth-service:3011": 1\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n# Legacy Backend (Auth 제외)\n{\n  "uri": "/*",\n  "name": "legacy-backend",\n  "priority": -1,\n  "upstream": {\n    "nodes": {\n      "host.docker.internal:3001": 1\n    }\n  }\n}\n</code></pre><ol start="4"><li><p><strong>Docker Compose 업데이트</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-yaml"># docker-compose.yml\nservices:\n  auth-service:\n    build: ./services/auth-service\n    ports:\n      - "3011:3011"\n    environment:\n      - DB_HOST=host.docker.internal\n      - DB_PORT=9090\n      - JWT_SECRET=${JWT_SECRET}\n    depends_on:\n      - apisix\n</code></pre><ol start="5"><li><p><strong>기존 Backend에서 Auth 라우트 제거</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-javascript">// backend/server.js\n// 제거: app.use('/api/auth', authRoutes);\n</code></pre><p><strong>검증:</strong></p><ul><li><p>[ ] 로그인/로그아웃 동작</p></li><li><p>[ ] 토큰 발급/갱신 동작</p></li><li><p>[ ] MFA 동작</p></li><li><p>[ ] 기존 기능 영향 없음</p></li></ul><p><strong>산출물:</strong></p><ul><li><p>[ ] Auth Service 소스코드</p></li><li><p>[ ] Dockerfile</p></li><li><p>[ ] API 문서 (OpenAPI)</p></li><li><p>[ ] 통합 테스트</p></li></ul><hr><h4><strong>Phase 3: Admin Service 분리 (3주)</strong></h4><p><strong>목표:</strong> 관리 기능을 독립 서비스로 분리</p><p><strong>작업 내용:</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>Admin Service 구현</strong></p><ul><li><p>사용자 관리 API</p></li><li><p>역할/권한 관리 API</p></li><li><p>메뉴/프로그램 관리 API</p></li><li><p>부서 관리 API</p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong>서비스 간 통신 구현</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-typescript">// Admin Service에서 Auth Service 호출\n// services/admin-service/src/clients/authClient.ts\nimport axios from 'axios';\n\nconst authClient = axios.create({\n  baseURL: process.env.AUTH_SERVICE_URL || 'http://auth-service:3011',\n});\n\nexport async function validateToken(token: string) {\n  const resp await authClient.get('/auth/validate', {\n    headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${token}` }\n  });\n  return response.data;\n}\n</code></pre><ol start="3"><li><p><strong>APISIX JWT 검증 활성화</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-yaml"># Admin API에 JWT 검증 적용\n{\n  "uri": "/admin/*",\n  "plugins": {\n    "jwt-auth": {\n      "key": "user-key",\n      "secret": "${JWT_SECRET}"\n    }\n  }\n}\n</code></pre><p><strong>검증:</strong></p><ul><li><p>[ ] 사용자 CRUD</p></li><li><p>[ ] 역할 관리</p></li><li><p>[ ] 메뉴 관리</p></li><li><p>[ ] 권한 검증</p></li></ul><p><strong>산출물:</strong></p><ul><li><p>[ ] Admin Service 소스코드</p></li><li><p>[ ] 서비스 간 통신 구현</p></li><li><p>[ ] API 문서</p></li></ul><hr><h4><strong>Phase 4: 나머지 서비스 분리 (4주)</strong></h4><p><strong>목표:</strong> Content, Communication, Common 서비스 분리</p><p><strong>4.1 Content Service (1.5주)</strong></p><ul><li><p>게시판 API</p></li><li><p>게시글/댓글 API</p></li><li><p>Q&amp;A API</p></li><li><p>도움말 API</p></li></ul><p><strong>4.2 Communication Service (1주)</strong></p><ul><li><p>메일 API</p></li><li><p>메시지 API</p></li></ul><p><strong>4.3 Common Service (1.5주)</strong></p><ul><li><p>코드 관리 API</p></li><li><p>첨부파일 API</p></li><li><p>로그 API</p></li><li><p>설정/대시보드 API</p></li></ul><p><strong>최종 APISIX 라우팅:</strong></p><pre><code class="language-yaml">routes:\n  - uri: /auth/*\n    upstream: auth-service:3011\n\n  - uri: /admin/*\n    upstream: admin-service:3012\n    plugins: [jwt-auth]\n\n  - uri: /content/*\n    upstream: content-service:3013\n    plugins: [jwt-auth]\n\n  - uri: /comm/*\n    upstream: communication-service:3014\n    plugins: [jwt-auth]\n\n  - uri: /common/*\n    upstream: common-service:3015\n    plugins: [jwt-auth]\n</code></pre><p><strong>검증:</strong></p><ul><li><p>[ ] 게시판 기능</p></li><li><p>[ ] 메일 기능</p></li><li><p>[ ] 코드/첨부파일 기능</p></li><li><p>[ ] 전체 통합 테스트</p></li></ul><hr><h4><strong>Phase 5: 안정화 및 최적화 (2주)</strong></h4><p><strong>목표:</strong> 성능 최적화, 모니터링, 문서화</p><p><strong>작업 내용:</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>모니터링 구축</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-yaml"># Prometheus + Grafana\nservices:\n  prometheus:\n    image: prom/prometheus\n    ports:\n      - "9090:9090"\n    volumes:\n      - ./prometheus.yml:/etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml\n\n  grafana:\n    image: grafana/grafana\n    ports:\n      - "3030:3000"\n</code></pre><ol start="2"><li><p><strong>로그 중앙화</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-yaml"># ELK 또는 Loki\nservices:\n  loki:\n    image: grafana/loki\n    ports:\n      - "3100:3100"\n</code></pre><ol start="3"><li><p><strong>캐싱 구현 (선택)</strong></p></li></ol><pre><code class="language-yaml">services:\n  redis:\n    image: redis:alpine\n    ports:\n      - "6379:6379"\n</code></pre><ol start="4"><li><p><strong>문서화</strong></p></li></ol><ul><li><p>API 문서 통합 (Swagger)</p></li><li><p>운영 가이드 작성</p></li><li><p>트러블슈팅 가이드</p></li></ul><p><strong>산출물:</strong></p><ul><li><p>[ ] 모니터링 대시보드</p></li><li><p>[ ] 통합 API 문서</p></li><li><p>[ ] 운영 가이드</p></li><li><p>[ ] 성능 테스트 결과</p></li></ul><hr><h3><strong>6.3 롤백 전략</strong></h3><p>각 Phase에서 문제 발생 시 롤백 방안:</p><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      Rollback Strategy                           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                  │\n│  [Phase 1-2 롤백]                                                │\n│  APISIX 라우팅을 기존 Backend로 변경                              │\n│  → uri: /* → upstream: legacy-backend                           │\n│                                                                  │\n│  [Phase 3-4 롤백]                                                │\n│  해당 서비스 라우팅을 기존 Backend로 변경                          │\n│  → 점진적 롤백 가능                                               │\n│                                                                  │\n│  [전체 롤백]                                                     │\n│  Frontend baseURL을 기존 Backend로 변경                           │\n│  → NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api                │\n│                                                                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><hr><h2><strong>7. 인프라 구성</strong></h2><h3><strong>7.1 Docker Compose 구성</strong></h3><pre><code class="language-yaml"># docker-compose.yml\nversion: '3.8'\n\nservices:\n  # ===== Infrastructure =====\n  nginx:\n    image: nginx:alpine\n    container_name: nginx-lb\n    ports:\n      - "80:80"\n      - "443:443"\n    volumes:\n      - ./infrastructure/nginx/nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf\n      - ./infrastructure/nginx/ssl:/etc/nginx/ssl\n    depends_on:\n      - apisix\n      - frontend\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  etcd:\n    image: bitnami/etcd:3.5\n    container_name: etcd\n    environment:\n      - ALLOW_Nyes\n      - ETCD_ADVERTISE_CLIENT_URLS=http://etcd:2379\n    ports:\n      - "2379:2379"\n    volumes:\n      - etcd_data:/bitnami/etcd\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  apisix:\n    image: apache/apisix:3.8.0-debian\n    container_name: apisix\n    ports:\n      - "9080:9080"\n      - "9180:9180"\n      - "9443:9443"\n    volumes:\n      - ./infrastructure/apisix/config.yaml:/usr/local/apisix/conf/config.yaml\n      - ./infrastructure/apisix/apisix.yaml:/usr/local/apisix/conf/apisix.yaml\n    depends_on:\n      - etcd\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  apisix-dashboard:\n    image: apache/apisix-dashboard:3.0.1-alpine\n    container_name: apisix-dashboard\n    ports:\n      - "9000:9000"\n    volumes:\n      - ./infrastructure/apisix/dashboard.yaml:/usr/local/apisix-dashboard/conf/conf.yaml\n    depends_on:\n      - apisix\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  # ===== Fr====\n  frontend:\n    build:\n      context: ./frontend\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    container_name: frontend\n    ports:\n      - "3000:3000"\n    environment:\n      - NEXT_PUBLIC_API_GATEWAY_URL=http://apisix:9080\n    depends_on:\n      - apisix\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  # ===== Backend Services =====\n  auth-service:\n    build:\n      context: ./services/auth-service\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    container_name: auth-service\n    ports:\n      - "3011:3011"\n    environment:\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n      - PORT=3011\n      - DB_HOST=${DB_HOST}\n      - DB_PORT=${DB_PORT}\n      - DB_NAME=${DB_NAME}\n      - DB_USER=${DB_USER}\n      - DB_PASSWORD=${DB_PASSWORD}\n      - JWT_SECRET=${JWT_SECRET}\n      - JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=${JWT_REFRESH_SECRET}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  admin-service:\n    build:\n      context: ./services/admin-service\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    container_name: admin-service\n    ports:\n      - "3012:3012"\n    environment:\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n      - PORT=3012\n      - DB_HOST=${DB_HOST}\n      - DB_PORT=${DB_PORT}\n      - DB_NAME=${DB_NAME}\n      - DB_USER=${DB_USER}\n      - DB_PASSWORD=${DB_PASSWORD}\n      - AUTH_SERVICE_URL=http://auth-service:3011\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  content-service:\n    build:\n      context: ./services/content-service\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    container_name: content-service\n    ports:\n      - "3013:3013"\n    environment:\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n      - PORT=3013\n      - DB_HOST=${DB_HOST}\n      - DB_PORT=${DB_PORT}\n      - DB_NAME=${DB_NAME}\n      - DB_USER=${DB_USER}\n      - DB_PASSWORD=${DB_PASSWORD}\n      - COMMhttp://common-service:3015\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  communication-service:\n    build:\n      context: ./services/communication-service\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    container_name: communication-service\n    ports:\n      - "3014:3014"\n    environment:\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n      - PORT=3014\n      - DB_HOST=${DB_HOST}\n      - DB_PORT=${DB_PORT}\n      - DB_NAME=${DB_NAME}\n      - DB_USER=${DB_USER}\n      - DB_PASSWORD=${DB_PASSWORD}\n      - ADMIN_SERVICE_URL=http://admin-service:3012\n      - COMMhttp://common-service:3015\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  common-service:\n    build:\n      context: ./services/common-service\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    container_name: common-service\n    ports:\n      - "3015:3015"\n    environment:\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n      - PORT=3015\n      - DB_HOST=${DB_HOST}\n      - DB_PORT=${DB_PORT}\n      - DB_NAME=${DB_NAME}\n      - DB_USER=${DB_USER}\n      - DB_PASSWORD=${DB_PASSWORD}\n    volumes:\n      - uploads_data:/app/uploads\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\n  # ===== Optional: Cache =====\n  redis:\n    image: redis:alpine\n    container_name: redis\n    ports:\n      - "6379:6379"\n    volumes:\n      - redis_data:/data\n    restart: unless-stopped\n\nvolumes:\n  etcd_data:\n  redis_data:\n  uploads_data:\n\nnetworks:\n  default:\n    name: enterprise-network\n</code></pre><h3><strong>7.2 개발 환경용 Docker Compose</strong></h3><pre><code class="language-yaml"># docker-compose.dev.yml\nversion: '3.8'\n\nservices:\n  # 개발 시에는 인프라만 Docker로 실행\n  etcd:\n    image: bitnami/etcd:3.5\n    environment:\n      - ALLOW_Nyes\n    ports:\n      - "2379:2379"\n\n  apisix:\n    image: apache/apisix:3.8.0-debian\n    ports:\n      - "9080:9080"\n      - "9180:9180"\n    volumes:\n      - ./infrastructure/apisix/config.yaml:/usr/local/apisix/conf/config.yaml\n    depends_on:\n      - etcd\n    extra_hosts:\n      - "host.docker.internal:host-gateway"\n\n  apisix-dashboard:\n    image: apache/apisix-dashboard:3.0.1-alpine\n    ports:\n      - "9000:9000"\n    volumes:\n      - ./infrastructure/apisix/dashboard.yaml:/usr/local/apisix-dashboard/conf/conf.yaml\n\n  redis:\n    image: redis:alpine\n    ports:\n      - "6379:6379"\n</code></pre><h3><strong>7.3 서비스별 Dockerfile</strong></h3><pre><code class="language-dockerfile"># services/auth-service/Dockerfile\nFROM node:20-alpine\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# shared 패키지 복사\nCOPY shared /shared\nWORKDIR /shared\nRUN npm install &amp;&amp; npm run build\n\n# 서비스 빌드\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY services/auth-service/package*.json ./\nRUN npm install\n\nCOPY services/auth-service/src ./src\nCOPY services/auth-service/tsconfig.json ./\nRUN npm run build\n\nEXPOSE 3011\n\nCMD ["node", "dist/server.js"]\n</code></pre><h3><strong>7.4 APISIX 상세 설정</strong></h3><pre><code class="language-yaml"># infrastructure/apisix/apisix.yaml\nroutes:\n  # Health Check\n  - uri: /health\n    name: health-check\n    upstream:\n      nodes:\n        "auth-service:3011": 1\n    plugins:\n      proxy-rewrite:\n        uri: "/health"\n\n  # Auth Service\n  - uri: /auth/*\n    name: auth-service\n    upstream:\n      type: roundrobin\n      nodes:\n        "auth-service:3011": 1\n    plugins:\n      proxy-rewrite:\n        regex_uri: ["^/auth/(.*)$", "/auth/$1"]\n\n  # Admin Service\n  - uri: /admin/*\n    name: admin-service\n    upstream:\n      type: roundrobin\n      nodes:\n        "admin-service:3012": 1\n    plugins:\n      jwt-auth:\n        key: user-key\n      proxy-rewrite:\n        regex_uri: ["^/admin/(.*)$", "/admin/$1"]\n\n  # Content Service\n  - uri: /content/*\n    name: content-service\n    upstream:\n      type: roundrobin\n      nodes:\n        "content-service:3013": 1\n    plugins:\n      jwt-auth:\n        key: user-key\n      proxy-rewrite:\n        regex_uri: ["^/content/(.*)$", "/content/$1"]\n\n  # Communication Service\n  - uri: /comm/*\n    name: communication-service\n    upstream:\n      type: roundrobin\n      nodes:\n        "communication-service:3014": 1\n    plugins:\n      jwt-auth:\n        key: user-key\n      proxy-rewrite:\n        regex_uri: ["^/comm/(.*)$", "/comm/$1"]\n\n  # Common Service\n  - uri: /common/*\n    name: common-service\n    upstream:\n      type: roundrobin\n      nodes:\n        "common-service:3015": 1\n    plugins:\n      jwt-auth:\n        key: user-key\n      proxy-rewrite:\n        regex_uri: ["^/common/(.*)$", "/common/$1"]\n\n# Global Plugins\nglobal_rules:\n  - id: 1\n    plugins:\n      cors:\n        allow_origins: "*"\n        allow_methods: "GET,POST,PUT,DELETE,OPTIONS"\n        allow_headers: "Authorization,Content-Type"\n\n      limit-req:\n        rate: 100\n        burst: 50\n        key: remote_addr\n        rejected_code: 429\n\n      prometheus:\n        prefer_name: true\n</code></pre><hr><h2><strong>8. 실행 일정</strong></h2><h3><strong>8.1 전체 타임라인</strong></h3><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                           MSA 전환 타임라인                                  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                             │\n│  Phase    │ Week 1 │ Week 2 │ Week 3 │ Week 4 │ Week 5 │ Week 6 │ ...      │\n│  ─────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────  │\n│  Phase 0  │████████│        │        │        │        │        │          │\n│  사전준비 │        │        │        │        │        │        │          │\n│           │        │        │        │        │        │        │          │\n│  Phase 1  │        │████████│████████│        │        │        │          │\n│  인프라   │        │        │        │        │        │        │          │\n│           │        │        │        │        │        │        │          │\n│  Phase 2  │        │        │        │████████│████████│        │          │\n│  Auth분리 │        │        │        │        │        │        │          │\n│           │        │        │        │        │        │        │          │\n│  ─────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────  │\n│           │ Week 7 │ Week 8 │ Week 9 │Week 10 │Week 11 │Week 12 │Week 13-14│\n│  ─────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────┼────────  │\n│  Phase 3  │████████│████████│████████│        │        │        │          │\n│  Admin분리│        │        │        │        │        │        │          │\n│           │        │        │        │        │        │        │          │\n│  Phase 4  │        │        │        │████████│████████│████████│████████  │\n│  나머지   │        │        │        │Content │Content │Comm    │Common    │\n│           │        │        │        │        │        │        │          │\n│  Phase 5  │        │        │        │        │        │        │████████  │\n│  안정화   │        │        │        │        │        │        │(Week15-16)│\n│                                                                             │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n총 예상 기간: 14-16주 (3.5-4개월)\n</code></pre><h3><strong>8.2 단계별 마일스톤</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 100px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>기간</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>마일스톤</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>담당</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 0</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>1주</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>개발 환경 구축 완료</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>DevOps</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 1</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>2주</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX 통한 기존 서비스 연동</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>DevOps + Backend</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 2</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>2주</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Auth Service 분리 완료</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Backend</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 3</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>3주</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Admin Service 분리 완료</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Backend</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 4</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>4주</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>전체 서비스 분리 완료</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Backend</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 5</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>2주</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>안정화 및 문서화 완료</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>전체</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>8.3 주요 체크포인트</strong></h3><pre><code>□ Phase 0 완료\n  ├── □ 디렉토리 구조 생성\n  ├── □ Docker Compose 기본 구성\n  └── □ 개발 환경 검증\n\n□ Phase 1 완료\n  ├── □ APISIX 동작 확인\n  ├── □ 기존 API 라우팅 확인\n  └── □ Frontend 연동 확인\n\n□ Phase 2 완료\n  ├── □ Auth Service 배포\n  ├── □ 로그인/로그아웃 동작\n  ├── □ 토큰 발급/갱신 동작\n  └── □ MFA 동작\n\n□ Phase 3 완료\n  ├── □ Admin Service 배포\n  ├── □ 사용자 관리 동작\n  ├── □ 역할/권한 관리 동작\n  └── □ 메뉴 관리 동작\n\n□ Phase 4 완료\n  ├── □ Content Service 배포\n  ├── □ Communication Service 배포\n  ├── □ Common Service 배포\n  └── □ 전체 기능 통합 테스트\n\n□ Phase 5 완료\n  ├── □ 모니터링 대시보드\n  ├── □ API 문서 완성\n  ├── □ 운영 가이드\n  └── □ 성능 테스트 완료\n</code></pre><hr><h2><strong>9. 검토 및 의사결정 필요사항</strong></h2><h3><strong>9.1 기술적 의사결정 필요</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 125px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>#</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>항목</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>옵션</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>권장</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>결정 필요 시점</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>1</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>서비스 간 통신</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>REST / gRPC</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>REST (단순성)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 2 전</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>2</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>JWT 검증 위치</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX / 각 서비스</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX (중앙화)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 1</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>3</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>세션 저장소</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Redis / DB</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Redis (성능)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 2</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>4</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>로그 수집</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>ELK / Loki / CloudWatch</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Loki (경량)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 5</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>5</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>API 버저닝</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>URL / Header</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>URL (/v1/)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 1</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>6</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>에러 응답 표준</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>RFC 7807 / Custom</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>RFC 7807</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 1</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>9.2 운영적 의사결정 필요</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 100px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>#</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>항목</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>설명</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>결정 필요 시점</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>1</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>배포 환경</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Dev/Staging/Prod 환경 구성</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 0</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>2</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>CI/CD 파이프라인</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>GitHub Actions / Jenkins / GitLab CI</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 1</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>3</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>도메인/SSL</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>운영 도메인 및 인증서</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 5</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>4</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>백업 전략</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>DB 백업 주기 및 방식</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 5</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>5</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>스케일링 정책</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Auto-scaling 기준</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Phase 5</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>9.3 추가 검토 필요사항</strong></h3><h4><strong>A. 데이터베이스 관련</strong></h4><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    DB 분리 로드맵 (향후)                         │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                  │\n│  현재 (Phase 1-5)          향후 Phase 6          향후 Phase 7   │\n│  ┌─────────────┐          ┌─────────────┐       ┌───────────┐  │\n│  │  단일 DB    │    →     │ 스키마 분리  │   →   │ 물리 분리  │  │\n│  │ (corenextdb)│          │(논리적 분리) │       │(개별 DB)   │  │\n│  └─────────────┘          └─────────────┘       └───────────┘  │\n│                                                                  │\n│  검토 필요사항:                                                  │\n│  • users 테이블 분리 방안 (Auth vs Admin)                       │\n│  • 외래키 참조 해결 방안                                         │\n│  • 데이터 동기화 전략 (Event Sourcing / CDC)                    │\n│  • 트랜잭션 처리 방안 (Saga Pattern)                            │\n│                                                                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><p><strong>검토 항목:</strong></p><ul><li><p>[ ] <code>users</code> 테이블의 Auth/Admin 분리 기준</p></li><li><p>[ ] 외래키로 연결된 테이블 매핑 분석</p></li><li><p>[ ] 분산 트랜잭션 필요 케이스 식별</p></li><li><p>[ ] Event-Driven 아키텍처 도입 시점</p></li></ul><h4><strong>B. 보안 관련</strong></h4><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 75px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>항목</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>현재</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>검토 필요</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>JWT Secret 관리</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>환경변수</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Vault / AWS Secrets Manager</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>API Key 관리</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>없음</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>외부 연동 시 필요</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Rate Limiting</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>없음</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX 플러그인 설정</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>DDoS 방어</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>없음</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>CloudFlare / AWS Shield</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>감사 로그</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>기본</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>상세 로깅 정책</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4><strong>C. 성능 관련</strong></h4><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>항목</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>검토 필요</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>캐싱 전략</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>어떤 데이터를 캐싱할 것인가</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>DB 커넥션 풀</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>서비스별 적정 풀 사이즈</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>파일 저장소</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>로컬 vs S3/MinIO</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>CDN</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Static 파일 서빙</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4><strong>D. 모니터링 관련</strong></h4><pre><code>검토 필요사항:\n├── 메트릭 수집 대상 정의\n├── 알람 임계값 설정\n├── 대시보드 구성\n├── 로그 보관 기간\n└── Tracing 도입 여부 (Jaeger/Zipkin)\n</code></pre><h3><strong>9.4 리스크 및 대응방안</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 100px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>리스크</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>영향도</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>가능성</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>대응방안</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>서비스 분리 중 기능 장애</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>높음</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중간</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Strangler Pattern, 점진적 이관</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>네트워크 레이턴시 증가</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중간</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>높음</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>캐싱, 서비스 간 통신 최적화</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>데이터 정합성 문제</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>높음</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중간</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>단일 DB 유지, 트랜잭션 관리</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>운영 복잡도 증가</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중간</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>높음</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>자동화, 모니터링 강화</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>개발 생산성 저하</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중간</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중간</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>공유 라이브러리, 문서화</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2><strong>10. 리스크 관리</strong></h2><h3><strong>10.1 기술적 리스크</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 100px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>리스크</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>가능성</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>영향</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>완화 전략</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX 학습 곡선</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>PoC 선행, 문서화</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>서비스 간 통신 실패</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>고</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Circuit Breaker, Retry</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>성능 저하</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>고</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>성능 테스트, 캐싱</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>데이터 불일치</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>저</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>고</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>단일 DB 유지</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>10.2 운영 리스크</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 100px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>리스크</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>가능성</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>영향</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>완화 전략</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>배포 실패</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>고</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Blue-Green 배포, 롤백 계획</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>서비스 장애 전파</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>고</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>장애 격리, Health Check</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>모니터링 누락</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>중</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>통합 모니터링 구축</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>10.3 롤백 계획</strong></h3><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                       Rollback Procedures                        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                  │\n│  Level 1: 단일 서비스 롤백                                       │\n│  ─────────────────────────                                      │\n│  1. 해당 서비스 이전 버전 배포                                   │\n│  2. APISIX 라우팅 변경 없음                                      │\n│  3. 영향 범위: 해당 서비스만                                     │\n│                                                                  │\n│  Level 2: 서비스 비활성화                                        │\n│  ─────────────────────────                                      │\n│  1. APISIX에서 해당 서비스 라우팅 제거                           │\n│  2. 기존 Backend로 라우팅 전환                                   │\n│  3. 영향 범위: 해당 도메인 기능                                  │\n│                                                                  │\n│  Level 3: 전체 롤백                                              │\n│  ─────────────────────────                                      │\n│  1. APISIX 모든 라우팅을 기존 Backend로 전환                     │\n│  2. Frontend API URL 롤백                                        │\n│  3. 영향 범위: 전체 시스템                                       │\n│                                                                  │\n│  롤백 명령어:                                                    │\n│  # Level 2 예시                                                  │\n│  curl -X PUT http://apisix:9180/apisix/admin/routes/auth \\      │\n│    -H "X-API-KEY: admin-key" \\                                  │\n│    -d '{"upstream":{"nodes":{"legacy-backend:3001":1}}}'        │\n│                                                                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><hr><h2><strong>부록</strong></h2><h3><strong>A. 용어 정의</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>용어</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>설명</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>MSA</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Microservices Architecture</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>API Gateway</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>API 라우팅 및 관리 서비스</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Apache APISIX, 고성능 API Gateway</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>etcd</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>분산 키-값 저장소</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Strangler Fig Pattern</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>점진적 마이그레이션 패턴</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Circuit Breaker</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>장애 전파 방지 패턴</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>B. 참고 자료</strong></h3><ul><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://apisix.apache.org/docs/">Apache APISIX Documentation</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://microservices.io/patterns/">Microservices Patterns</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://docs.docker.com/compose/">Docker Compose Documentation</a></