8b0b357c-42fd-4a1e-a577-e9fab2754282	78516af9-bd41-4d98-a553-f64dfa9eef5e	Windows 로컬 개발 환경 구성 가이드	<h1><strong>Windows 로컬 개발 환경 구성 가이드</strong></h1><blockquote><p>작성일: 2024-12-08 대상: Windows 10/11 개발자</p></blockquote><hr><h2><strong>목차</strong></h2><ol><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/local-dev-setup-windows.md#1-%EC%82%AC%EC%A0%84-%EC%9A%94%EA%B5%AC%EC%82%AC%ED%95%AD">사전 요구사항</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/local-dev-setup-windows.md#2-%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C-%ED%99%98%EA%B2%BD-%EC%98%B5%EC%85%98">개발 환경 옵션</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/local-dev-setup-windows.md#3-%EA%B6%8C%EC%9E%A5-%EA%B5%AC%EC%84%B1-%ED%95%98%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%8C%EB%A6%AC%EB%93%9C-%EB%B0%A9%EC%8B%9D">권장 구성: 하이브리드 방식</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/local-dev-setup-windows.md#4-%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95">설치 및 설정</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/local-dev-setup-windows.md#5-%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C-%EC%9B%8C%ED%81%AC%ED%94%8C%EB%A1%9C%EC%9A%B0">개발 워크플로우</a></p></li><li><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://file+.vscode-resource.vscode-cdn.net/e%3A/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app/docs/local-dev-setup-windows.md#6-%ED%8A%B8%EB%9F%AC%EB%B8%94%EC%8A%88%ED%8C%85">트러블슈팅</a></p></li></ol><hr><h2><strong>1. 사전 요구사항</strong></h2><h3><strong>1.1 필수 소프트웨어</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 100px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>소프트웨어</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>버전</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>용도</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>설치 링크</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>Node.js</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>20 LTS</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>런타임</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://nodejs.org/">https://nodejs.org/</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>Docker Desktop</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Latest</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>컨테이너</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/">https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>Git</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Latest</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>버전관리</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://git-scm.com/">https://git-scm.com/</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><strong>VS Code</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Latest</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>IDE</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://code.visualstudio.com/">https://code.visualstudio.com/</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><strong>1.2 권장 VS Code 확장</strong></h3><pre><code>- ESLint\n- Prettier\n- Docker\n- Thunder Client (API 테스트)\n- GitLens\n- PostgreSQL (by Chris Kolkman)\n</code></pre><h3><strong>1.3 시스템 요구사항</strong></h3><ul><li><p><strong>RAM</strong>: 최소 16GB (권장 32GB)</p></li><li><p><strong>Storage</strong>: SSD 50GB 이상 여유공간</p></li><li><p><strong>OS</strong>: Windows 10/11 Pro (Docker 사용 위해 Hyper-V 필요)</p></li></ul><hr><h2><strong>2. 개발 환경 옵션</strong></h2><h3><strong>Option A: 전체 Docker (비권장)</strong></h3><pre><code>┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│           Docker Desktop                  │\n│  ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐    │\n│  │Nginx │ │APISIX│ │Frontend│ │Services│ │\n│  └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘    │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n단점:\n- 느린 파일 시스템 (Volume Mount)\n- Hot Reload 느림\n- 디버깅 어려움\n</code></pre><h3><strong>Option B: 전체 로컬 (비권장)</strong></h3><pre><code>Windows에서 직접 실행:\n- Node.js 서비스들\n- APISIX (Windows 미지원)  ← 문제!\n- etcd (설정 복잡)\n\n단점:\n- APISIX가 Windows 네이티브 미지원\n- 환경 설정 복잡\n</code></pre><h3><strong>Option C: 하이브리드 (권장) ✅</strong></h3><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    Windows Host                              │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐│\n│  │  Node.js 직접 실행 (Hot Reload 빠름)                    ││\n│  │  ├── Frontend (npm run dev)        → localhost:3000     ││\n│  │  ├── Auth Service (npm run dev)    → localhost:3011     ││\n│  │  ├── Admin Service (npm run dev)   → localhost:3012     ││\n│  │  ├── Content Service (npm run dev) → localhost:3013     ││\n│  │  ├── Comm Service (npm run dev)    → localhost:3014     ││\n│  │  └── Common Service (npm run dev)  → localhost:3015     ││\n│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘│\n│                           │                                  │\n│                           ▼                                  │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐│\n│  │  Docker Desktop (인프라만)                              ││\n│  │  ├── APISIX          → localhost:9080                   ││\n│  │  ├── APISIX Dashboard → localhost:9000                  ││\n│  │  ├── etcd            → localhost:2379                   ││\n│  │  └── Redis (선택)    → localhost:6379                   ││\n│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘│\n│                           │                                  │\n│                           ▼                                  │\n│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐│\n│  │  원격 PostgreSQL (기존 유지)                            ││\n│  │  └── 123.37.36.45:9090                                  ││\n│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘│\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n장점:\n✅ 빠른 Hot Reload\n✅ 쉬운 디버깅 (VS Code 직접 연결)\n✅ APISIX는 Docker로 안정적 실행\n✅ 리소스 효율적\n</code></pre><hr><h2><strong>3. 권장 구성: 하이브리드 방식</strong></h2><h3><strong>3.1 아키텍처</strong></h3><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     Development Architecture                     │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                  │\n│  Browser                                                         │\n│     │                                                            │\n│     ▼                                                            │\n│  localhost:3000  ─────────────────┐                              │\n│  (Frontend)                       │                              │\n│     │                             │                              │\n│     │ API 호출                    │ 직접 호출 (개발 시)          │\n│     ▼                             ▼                              │\n│  localhost:9080  ◄──────────  localhost:3011~3015               │\n│  (APISIX)                     (Backend Services)                 │\n│     │                             │                              │\n│     │ 라우팅                      │                              │\n│     ▼                             ▼                              │\n│  localhost:3011~3015          123.37.36.45:9090                 │\n│  (Backend Services)           (PostgreSQL)                       │\n│                                                                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h3><strong>3.2 두 가지 개발 모드</strong></h3><h4><strong>Mode 1: APISIX 경유 (통합 테스트)</strong></h4><pre><code>Frontend → APISIX (9080) → Backend Services\n- API Gateway 동작 확인\n- 라우팅/인증 테스트\n</code></pre><h4><strong>Mode 2: 직접 연결 (빠른 개발)</strong></h4><pre><code>Frontend → Backend Service 직접 (3011~3015)\n- 개별 서비스 개발 시\n- 디버깅 시\n</code></pre><hr><h2><strong>4. 설치 및 설정</strong></h2><h3><strong>4.1 디렉토리 구조 생성</strong></h3><pre><code class="language-powershell"># PowerShell에서 실행\ncd E:\\apps\\nextjs-enterprise-app\n\n# 디렉토리 구조 생성\nmkdir -p infrastructure/docker\nmkdir -p infrastructure/apisix\nmkdir -p infrastructure/nginx\nmkdir -p services/auth-service/src\nmkdir -p services/admin-service/src\nmkdir -p services/content-service/src\nmkdir -p services/communication-service/src\nmkdir -p services/common-service/src\nmkdir -p shared/types\nmkdir -p shared/utils\nmkdir -p shared/middleware\nmkdir -p shared/config\n</code></pre><h3><strong>4.2 Docker Compose 설정 (인프라용)</strong></h3><pre><code class="language-yaml"># infrastructure/docker/docker-compose.dev.yml\n\nversion: '3.8'\n\nservices:\n  # etcd - APISIX 설정 저장소\n  etcd:\n    image: bitnami/etcd:3.5\n    container_name: etcd\n    environment:\n      - ALLOW_Nyes\n      - ETCD_ADVERTISE_CLIENT_URLS=http://etcd:2379\n    ports:\n      - "2379:2379"\n      - "2380:2380"\n    volumes:\n      - etcd_data:/bitnami/etcd\n    networks:\n      - dev-network\n\n  # APISIX - API Gateway\n  apisix:\n    image: apache/apisix:3.8.0-debian\n    container_name: apisix\n    ports:\n      - "9080:9080"    # API Gateway\n      - "9180:9180"    # Admin API\n      - "9443:9443"    # HTTPS\n    volumes:\n      - ../apisix/config.yaml:/usr/local/apisix/conf/config.yaml:ro\n      - ../apisix/apisix.yaml:/usr/local/apisix/conf/apisix.yaml:ro\n    depends_on:\n      - etcd\n    networks:\n      - dev-network\n    # Windows host 접근을 위한 설정\n    extra_hosts:\n      - "host.docker.internal:host-gateway"\n\n  # APISIX Dashboard - 관리 UI\n  apisix-dashboard:\n    image: apache/apisix-dashboard:3.0.1-alpine\n    container_name: apisix-dashboard\n    ports:\n      - "9000:9000"\n    volumes:\n      - ../apisix/dashboard.yaml:/usr/local/apisix-dashboard/conf/conf.yaml:ro\n    depends_on:\n      - apisix\n    networks:\n      - dev-network\n\n  # Redis - 캐시/세션 (선택)\n  redis:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    container_name: redis\n    ports:\n      - "6379:6379"\n    volumes:\n      - redis_data:/data\n    networks:\n      - dev-network\n    command: redis-server --appendonly yes\n\nvolumes:\n  etcd_data:\n  redis_data:\n\nnetworks:\n  dev-network:\n    driver: bridge\n</code></pre><h3><strong>4.3 APISIX 설정</strong></h3><pre><code class="language-yaml"># infrastructure/apisix/config.yaml\n\napisix:\n  node_listen: 9080\n  enable_ipv6: false\n  enable_admin: true\n  admin_key:\n    - name: admin\n      key: edd1c9f034335f136f87ad84b625c8f1  # 개발용 키\n      role: admin\n\ndeployment:\n  admin:\n    admin_listen:\n      ip: 0.0.0.0\n      port: 9180\n    https_admin: false\n\n  etcd:\n    host:\n      - "http://etcd:2379"\n    prefix: "/apisix"\n    timeout: 30\n\nplugin_attr:\n  prometheus:\n    export_addr:\n      ip: "0.0.0.0"\n      port: 9091\n</code></pre><pre><code class="language-yaml"># infrastructure/apisix/apisix.yaml\n# 개발 환경용 라우팅 설정 (Standalone 모드)\n\nroutes:\n  # Auth Service\n  - uri: /auth/*\n    name: auth-service-dev\n    upstream:\n      type: roundrobin\n      nodes:\n        "host.docker.internal:3011": 1\n    plugins:\n      proxy-rewrite:\n        regex_uri: ["^/auth/(.*)$", "/auth/$1"]\n\n  # Admin Service\n  - uri: /admin/*\n    name: admin-service-dev\n    upstream:\n      type: roundrobin\n      nodes:\n        "host.docker.internal:3012": 1\n    plugins:\n      proxy-rewrite:\n        regex_uri: ["^/admin/(.*)$", "/admin/$1"]\n\n  # Content Service\n  - uri: /content/*\n    name: content-service-dev\n    upstream:\n      type: roundrobin\n      nodes:\n        "host.docker.internal:3013": 1\n    plugins:\n      proxy-rewrite:\n        regex_uri: ["^/content/(.*)$", "/content/$1"]\n\n  # Communication Service\n  - uri: /comm/*\n    name: comm-service-dev\n    upstream:\n      type: roundrobin\n      nodes:\n        "host.docker.internal:3014": 1\n    plugins:\n      proxy-rewrite:\n        regex_uri: ["^/comm/(.*)$", "/comm/$1"]\n\n  # Common Service\n  - uri: /common/*\n    name: common-service-dev\n    upstream:\n      type: roundrobin\n      nodes:\n        "host.docker.internal:3015": 1\n    plugins:\n      proxy-rewrite:\n        regex_uri: ["^/common/(.*)$", "/common/$1"]\n\n  # Legacy Backend (마이그레이션 중 사용)\n  - uri: /api/*\n    name: legacy-backend\n    priority: -1\n    upstream:\n      type: roundrobin\n      nodes:\n        "host.docker.internal:3001": 1\n\n#END\n</code></pre><pre><code class="language-yaml"># infrastructure/apisix/dashboard.yaml\n\nconf:\n  listen:\n    host: 0.0.0.0\n    port: 9000\n  etcd:\n    endpoints:\n      - "http://etcd:2379"\n    prefix: "/apisix"\n  log:\n    error_log:\n      level: warn\n      file_path: /dev/stderr\n    access_log:\n      file_path: /dev/stdout\n\nauthentication:\n  secret: secret\n  expire_time: 3600\n  users:\n    - username: admin\n      password: admin\n</code></pre><h3><strong>4.4 개발 스크립트 설정</strong></h3><pre><code class="language-json">// package.json (루트)에 추가\n\n{\n  "scripts": {\n    "dev": "concurrently \\"npm run dev:frontend\\" \\"npm run dev:backend\\"",\n    "dev:frontend": "cd src &amp;&amp; npm run dev",\n    "dev:backend": "cd backend &amp;&amp; npm run dev",\n\n    "dev:infra": "cd infrastructure/docker &amp;&amp; docker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d",\n    "dev:infra:down": "cd infrastructure/docker &amp;&amp; docker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml down",\n    "dev:infra:logs": "cd infrastructure/docker &amp;&amp; docker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml logs -f",\n\n    "dev:auth": "cd services/auth-service &amp;&amp; npm run dev",\n    "dev:admin": "cd services/admin-service &amp;&amp; npm run dev",\n    "dev:content": "cd services/content-service &amp;&amp; npm run dev",\n    "dev:comm": "cd services/communication-service &amp;&amp; npm run dev",\n    "dev:common": "cd services/common-service &amp;&amp; npm run dev",\n\n    "dev:services": "concurrently \\"npm run dev:auth\\" \\"npm run dev:admin\\" \\"npm run dev:content\\" \\"npm run dev:comm\\" \\"npm run dev:common\\"",\n\n    "dev:all": "concurrently \\"npm run dev:infra\\" \\"npm run dev:frontend\\" \\"npm run dev:services\\""\n  }\n}\n</code></pre><h3><strong>4.5 환경 변수 설정</strong></h3><pre><code class="language-env"># .env.development (루트 디렉토리)\n\n# Database (기존 원격 DB)\nDB_HOST=123.37.36.45\nDB_PORT=9090\nDB_NAME=corenextdb\nDB_USER=corenext\nDB_PASSWORD=CoreNext2025#\n\n# JWT\nJWT_SECRET=your-jwt-secret-key-here\nJWT_REFRESH_SECRET=your-jwt-refresh-secret-key-here\n\n# Services URLs (로컬)\nAUTH_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:3011\nADMIN_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:3012\nChttp://localhost:3013\nCOMM_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:3014\nCOMMhttp://localhost:3015\n\n# API Gateway\nAPISIX_URL=http://localhost:9080\n\n# Redis\nREDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379\n\n# Frontend\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:9080\n</code></pre><pre><code class="language-env"># .env.development.local (Frontend용, src/ 또는 frontend/)\n\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_GATEWAY_URL=http://localhost:9080\n\n# 개발 시 직접 연결 (선택적)\n# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api\n</code></pre><h3><strong>4.6 PowerShell 개발 스크립트</strong></h3><pre><code class="language-powershell"># scripts/dev-start.ps1\n# 개발 환경 전체 시작\n\nWrite-Host "🚀 Starting Development Environment..." -ForegroundColor Cyan\n\n# 1. Docker 인프라 시작\nWrite-Host "`n📦 Starting Docker Infrastructure..." -ForegroundColor Yellow\nSet-Location E:\\apps\\nextjs-enterprise-app\\infrastructure\\docker\ndocker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d\n\n# 대기\nWrite-Host "Waiting for services to be ready..." -ForegroundColor Gray\nStart-Sleep -Seconds 10\n\n# 2. APISIX 상태 확인\nWrite-Host "`n🔍 Checking APISIX..." -ForegroundColor Yellow\ntry {\n    $resp Invoke-WebRequest -Uri "http://localhost:9080/apisix/status" -UseBasicParsing -TimeoutSec 5\n    Write-Host "✅ APISIX is running" -ForegroundColor Green\n} catch {\n    Write-Host "⚠️  APISIX not ready yet, please wait..." -ForegroundColor Yellow\n}\n\n# 3. 서비스 URL 출력\nWrite-Host "`n📋 Service URLs:" -ForegroundColor Cyan\nWrite-Host "  Frontend:         http://localhost:3000" -ForegroundColor White\nWrite-Host "  APISIX Gateway:   http://localhost:9080" -ForegroundColor White\nWrite-Host "  APISIX Dashboard: http://localhost:9000" -ForegroundColor White\nWrite-Host "  Legacy Backend:   http://localhost:3001" -ForegroundColor White\nWrite-Host ""\nWrite-Host "  Auth Service:     http://localhost:3011" -ForegroundColor Gray\nWrite-Host "  Admin Service:    http://localhost:3012" -ForegroundColor Gray\nWrite-Host "  Content Service:  http://localhost:3013" -ForegroundColor Gray\nWrite-Host "  Comm Service:     http://localhost:3014" -ForegroundColor Gray\nWrite-Host "  Common Service:   http://localhost:3015" -ForegroundColor Gray\n\nWrite-Host "`n💡 Run the following in separate terminals:" -ForegroundColor Cyan\nWrite-Host "  npm run dev          # Frontend + Legacy Backend" -ForegroundColor White\nWrite-Host "  npm run dev:auth     # Auth Service" -ForegroundColor White\nWrite-Host "  npm run dev:admin    # Admin Service" -ForegroundColor White\n\nSet-Location E:\\apps\\nextjs-enterprise-app\n</code></pre><pre><code class="language-powershell"># scripts/dev-stop.ps1\n# 개발 환경 전체 중지\n\nWrite-Host "🛑 Stopping Development Environment..." -ForegroundColor Cyan\n\nSet-Location E:\\apps\\nextjs-enterprise-app\\infrastructure\\docker\ndocker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml down\n\nWrite-Host "✅ Development environment stopped" -ForegroundColor Green\nSet-Location E:\\apps\\nextjs-enterprise-app\n</code></pre><hr><h2><strong>5. 개발 워크플로우</strong></h2><h3><strong>5.1 일반 개발 순서</strong></h3><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    Daily Development Workflow                    │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                  │\n│  1. 인프라 시작 (한 번만)                                        │\n│     PS&gt; .\\scripts\\dev-start.ps1                                 │\n│     또는                                                         │\n│     PS&gt; npm run dev:infra                                       │\n│                                                                  │\n│  2. 개발 서버 시작 (터미널 1)                                    │\n│     PS&gt; npm run dev                                             │\n│     → Frontend (3000) + Legacy Backend (3001)                   │\n│                                                                  │\n│  3. 마이크로서비스 개발 시 (터미널 2+)                           │\n│     PS&gt; npm run dev:auth     # Auth 서비스 개발 시              │\n│     PS&gt; npm run dev:admin    # Admin 서비스 개발 시             │\n│     ...                                                          │\n│                                                                  │\n│  4. 테스트                                                       │\n│     - Browser: http://localhost:3000                            │\n│     - APISIX Dashboard: http://localhost:9000 (admin/admin)     │\n│     - API 테스트: Thunder Client 또는 curl                      │\n│                                                                  │\n│  5. 종료                                                         │\n│     PS&gt; .\\scripts\\dev-stop.ps1                                  │\n│     또는                                                         │\n│     PS&gt; npm run dev:infra:down                                  │\n│                                                                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h3><strong>5.2 VS Code 터미널 구성</strong></h3><pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  VS Code                                                         │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                  │\n│  Terminal 1: Frontend                                            │\n│  └─ npm run dev (또는 cd src &amp;&amp; npm run dev)                    │\n│                                                                  │\n│  Terminal 2: Legacy Backend                                      │\n│  └─ cd backend &amp;&amp; npm run dev                                   │\n│                                                                  │\n│  Terminal 3: Auth Service (필요시)                               │\n│  └─ cd services/auth-service &amp;&amp; npm run dev                     │\n│                                                                  │\n│  Terminal 4: Docker Logs (필요시)                                │\n│  └─ npm run dev:infra:logs                                      │\n│                                                                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code></pre><h3><strong>5.3 VS Code Launch 설정</strong></h3><pre><code class="language-json">// .vscode/launch.json\n\n{\n  "version": "0.2.0",\n  "configurations": [\n    {\n      "name": "Debug Frontend",\n      "type": "chrome",\n      "request": "launch",\n      "url": "http://localhost:3000",\n      "webRoot": "${workspaceFolder}/src"\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Debug Legacy Backend",\n      "type": "node",\n      "request": "launch",\n      "runtimeExecutable": "npm",\n      "runtimeArgs": ["run", "dev"],\n      "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}/backend",\n      "console": "integratedTerminal"\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Debug Auth Service",\n      "type": "node",\n      "request": "launch",\n      "runtimeExecutable": "npm",\n      "runtimeArgs": ["run", "dev"],\n      "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}/services/auth-service",\n      "console": "integratedTerminal",\n      "env": {\n        "PORT": "3011"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Debug Admin Service",\n      "type": "node",\n      "request": "launch",\n      "runtimeExecutable": "npm",\n      "runtimeArgs": ["run", "dev"],\n      "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}/services/admin-service",\n      "console": "integratedTerminal",\n      "env": {\n        "PORT": "3012"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  "compounds": [\n    {\n      "name": "Full Stack Debug",\n      "configurations": ["Debug Frontend", "Debug Legacy Backend"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</code></pre><h3><strong>5.4 API 테스트 방법</strong></h3><h4><strong>Thunder Client (VS Code Extension)</strong></h4><pre><code># APISIX 경유 테스트\nPOST http://localhost:9080/auth/login\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  "loginid": "admin",\n  "password": "password"\n}\n\n# 직접 서비스 테스트\nPOST http://localhost:3011/auth/login\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  "loginid": "admin",\n  "password": "password"\n}\n</code></pre><h4><strong>curl (PowerShell)</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-powershell"># APISIX Health Check\ncurl http://localhost:9080/apisix/status\n\n# Auth 서비스 테스트\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:9080/auth/login `\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" `\n  -d '{"loginid":"admin","password":"password"}'\n\n# Legacy Backend 테스트\ncurl http://localhost:3001/api/health\n</code></pre><h3><strong>5.5 개발 단계별 설정</strong></h3><h4><strong>Phase 1: 기존 모놀리식 + APISIX</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-env"># Frontend (.env.development.local)\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:9080/api\n\n# APISIX 라우팅: 모든 요청을 Legacy Backend로\n</code></pre><h4><strong>Phase 2+: 점진적 서비스 분리</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-env"># Frontend (.env.development.local)\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_GATEWAY_URL=http://localhost:9080\n\n# APISIX 라우팅:\n# /auth/* → Auth Service (3011)\n# /api/*  → Legacy Backend (3001)  # 나머지\n</code></pre><hr><h2><strong>6. 트러블슈팅</strong></h2><h3><strong>6.1 Docker 관련</strong></h3><h4><strong>Docker Desktop이 시작되지 않음</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-powershell"># Hyper-V 확인\nGet-WindowsOptionalFeature -Online -FeatureName Microsoft-Hyper-V\n\n# WSL2 백엔드 사용 시 WSL 상태 확인\nwsl --status\nwsl --update\n</code></pre><h4><strong>포트 충돌</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-powershell"># 사용 중인 포트 확인\nnetstat -ano | findstr :9080\nnetstat -ano | findstr :3000\n\n# 프로세스 종료\ntaskkill /PID &lt;PID&gt; /F\n</code></pre><h4><strong>Volume Mount 느림 (Docker)</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-yaml"># docker-compose.dev.yml에서 Volume 최소화\n# 설정 파일만 마운트, 소스코드는 마운트하지 않음\nvolumes:\n  - ../apisix/config.yaml:/usr/local/apisix/conf/config.yaml:ro\n</code></pre><h3><strong>6.2 APISIX 관련</strong></h3><h4><strong>APISIX 연결 실패</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-powershell"># 컨테이너 상태 확인\ndocker ps\ndocker logs apisix\n\n# etcd 연결 확인\ndocker logs etcd\n\n# APISIX 재시작\ndocker-compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml restart apisix\n</code></pre><h4><strong>라우팅이 작동하지 않음</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-powershell"># APISIX Admin API로 라우트 확인\ncurl http://localhost:9180/apisix/admin/routes `\n  -H "X-API-KEY: edd1c9f034335f136f87ad84b625c8f1"\n\n# host.docker.internal 확인\ndocker exec apisix ping host.docker.internal\n</code></pre><h4><strong>APISIX에서 Windows 호스트 연결 안됨</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-yaml"># docker-compose.dev.yml에 추가\nservices:\n  apisix:\n    extra_hosts:\n      - "host.docker.internal:host-gateway"\n</code></pre><h3><strong>6.3 Node.js 서비스 관련</strong></h3><h4><strong>포트 이미 사용 중</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-powershell"># 특정 포트 사용 프로세스 찾기\nnetstat -ano | findstr :3011\n\n# Node 프로세스 모두 종료\ntaskkill /IM node.exe /F\n</code></pre><h4><strong>환경 변수 로드 안됨</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-powershell"># dotenv 확인\nnpm install dotenv\n\n# 서비스 시작 시 명시적 로드\nnode -r dotenv/config src/server.js\n</code></pre><h3><strong>6.4 네트워크 관련</strong></h3><h4><strong>CORS 오류</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-typescript">// Backend 서비스에 CORS 설정\nimport cors from 'cors';\n\napp.use(cors({\n  origin: ['http://localhost:3000', 'http://localhost:9080'],\n  credentials: true\n}));\n</code></pre><h4><strong>방화벽 차단</strong></h4><pre><code class="language-powershell"># Windows Defender 방화벽에서 Node.js 허용\n# 또는 개발 중 일시적으로 비활성화 (권장하지 않음)\n</code></pre><h3><strong>6.5 자주 발생하는 오류</strong></h3><table class="editor-table" style="min-width: 75px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>오류</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>원인</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>해결</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:9080</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>APISIX 미실행</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>npm run dev:infra</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>EADDRINUSE :::3000</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>포트 사용 중</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>기존 프로세스 종료</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>host.docker.internal not found</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Docker 설정</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>extra_hosts 추가</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>etcd connection refused</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>etcd 미실행</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Docker 컨테이너 확인</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p><code>JWT malformed</code></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>토큰 형식 오류</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>환경변수 확인</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2><strong>부록: 빠른 시작 체크리스트</strong></h2><pre><code>□ 사전 준비\n  ├── □ Node.js 20 LTS 설치\n  ├── □ Docker Desktop 설치 및 실행\n  ├── □ Git 설치\n  └── □ VS Code 및 확장 설치\n\n□ 프로젝트 설정\n  ├── □ 저장소 클론\n  ├── □ npm install (루트)\n  ├── □ .env.development 파일 생성\n  └── □ infrastructure 디렉토리 설정\n\n□ 개발 시작\n  ├── □ npm run dev:infra (Docker 인프라 시작)\n  ├── □ APISIX Dashboard 접속 확인 (localhost:9000)\n  ├── □ npm run dev (Frontend + Backend)\n  └── □ localhost:3000 접속 확인\n\n□ 문제 발생 시\n  ├── □ docker ps로 컨테이너 상태 확인\n  ├── □ docker logs &lt;container&gt;로 로그 확인\n  └── □ 포트 충돌 확인 (netstat)</code></pre>	admin	관리자	DEPT-132	f	normal	published	f	\N	f	t	\N	\N	0	0	0	0	[]	{}	'-08':16B '-1':738B '-12':15B '/admin':633B,651B,652B '/api':732B,1685B '/apisix':586B,758B '/apisix/apisix.yaml':455B '/apisix/config.yaml':452B,1758B '/apisix/dashboard.yaml':496B '/auth':609B,627B,628B,1681B '/backend':1517B '/bitnami/etcd':423B '/comm':681B,699B,700B '/common':705B,723B,724B '/content':657B,675B,676B '/data':524B '/dev/stderr':766B '/dev/stdout':771B '/f':1742B,1854B '/im':1852B '/pid':1740B '/products/docker-desktop/':59B '/services/admin-service':1556B '/services/auth-service':1535B '/src':1501B '/usr/local/apisix-dashboard/conf/conf.yaml':497B '/usr/local/apisix/conf/apisix.yaml':456B '/usr/local/apisix/conf/config.yaml':453B,1759B '0.0.0.0':575B,595B,750B '0.2.0':1487B '1':37B,295B,620B,629B,644B,653B,668B,677B,692B,701B,716B,725B,744B,1048B,1345B,1367B,1440B,1647B '1.1':40B '1.2':69B '1.3':86B '10':1095B '10/11':19B,101B '123.37.36.45':235B,284B,936B '127.0.0.1':1917B '16gb':91B '2':110B,313B,1096B,1362B,1382B,1452B,1666B '20':49B,1963B '2024':14B '2379':226B,414B,416B,417B,584B,756B '2380':418B,419B '3':253B,1139B,1377B,1461B '3.0.1':485B '3.1':258B '3.2':289B '3.5':402B '3.8':393B '3.8.0':434B '30':588B '3000':178B,264B,1156B,1373B,1405B,1498B,1736B,1890B,1926B,2012B '3001':1183B,1376B,1688B '3001/api':1030B '3001/api/health':1641B '3011':185B,275B,282B,322B,975B,1195B,1540B,1684B,1846B '3011/auth/login':1601B '3012':192B,980B,1204B,1561B '3013':199B,982B,1213B '3014':206B,987B,1222B '3015':213B,989B,1231B '32gb':93B '3600':777B '4':330B,1401B,1471B '4.1':334B '4.2':386B '4.3':546B '4.4':783B '4.5':923B '4.6':1031B '5':1118B,1335B,1417B '5.1':1338B '